Subject: wmp: convert volume percentages to logarithmic attenuation
License: LGPL-2.1-or-later
Modification date: 2026-10-25

Map the WMP volume percentage to IBasicAudio hundredths of a decibel using
the amplitude ratio. Preserve silence at zero and full volume at one hundred.
Validate the documented input range before storing the setting.

